{
  "name": "SmartLobby - Visitor Routing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SmartLobby - Visitor Routing\nVisitor scans QR -> the employee decides where they go -> if the employee is busy, the front desk calls and logs the answer -> visitor is emailed, board and front desk updated.\n\n**Setup:** connect Gmail, Google Sheets and Telegram credentials; replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` (3 Sheets nodes) and `YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID` (3 Telegram nodes); edit emails in `Employee Directory` and `Front Desk: Log Call Result`.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "eacd0548-5242-46dd-a071-022f734c8248",
      "name": "Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        5072,
        -900
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Stage 1 - Check-in\nForm -> find employee email + Visit ID -> add row 'Waiting for host' -> Telegram: new visitor",
        "height": 164,
        "width": 312,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e138b120-9e88-4fbd-9574-4c5b7767cb1e",
      "name": "Note - Step 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        5776,
        -704
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Stage 2 - Ask the employee\nEmail with a one-click form. Waits up to 10 min.\n(Set to 1 min for testing.)",
        "height": 164,
        "width": 268,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "6707d83b-8dcb-4a63-9095-b1fc6c01e9c4",
      "name": "Note - Step 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        6480,
        -720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Stage 3 - Route the visitor\n**Top (employee answered):** Build Instructions -> email visitor + update board + tell front desk.\n\n**Bottom (no answer):** Telegram tells front desk to CALL -> row turns red 'calling' -> front desk records the call result in the email form -> joins the top path.",
        "height": 188,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "7d324002-50a6-4f2e-a60f-124965c56cce",
      "name": "Note - Step 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        7184,
        -720
      ]
    },
